<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@/~part_III__cl_10__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Chairman shall preside at all meetings of the Council but if the Chairman is absent from any meeting, the members present shall elect one from among themselves to preside at that meeting."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@> .
