<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@/~part_III__cl_10__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Seven members, including the Chairman, shall constitute a quorum for a meeting of the Council."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@> .
