<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@/~part_IV__cl_12__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Chief Statistician may, by notice in writing, direct any person to furnish such data within the person’s knowledge or which the person is reasonably able to obtain, in the form and manner and within the period specified in the notice or such extended period as the Chief Statistician may grant."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@> .
