<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@/~part_IV__cl_12__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@/~part_IV__cl_12__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person directed to furnish data under subsection (1) shall ensure that the data furnished is true, accurate and complete, and shall provide an express representation to that effect, including a declaration the person is not aware of any other data that would render the furnished data untrue or misleading."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@/~part_IV__cl_12__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@/~part_IV__cl_12> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@/~part_IV__cl_12__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "4" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@/~part_IV__cl_12__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@/~part_IV__cl_12__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "If the person directed to furnish data under subsection (1) does not have the data, or the data is incomplete, the person shall notify the Chief Statistician in the form and manner and within the period as specified in the notice."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@/~part_IV__cl_12__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@/~part_IV__cl_12> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@/~part_IV__cl_12__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "5" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@/~part_IV__cl_12__subsec_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@/~part_IV__cl_12__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who contravenes subsection (3) commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding fifty thousand ringgit and in the case of a continuing offence, to a further fine not exceeding two thousand ringgit for each day during which the offence continues after conviction. Request for data"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@> .
