<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@/~part_VI__cl_22__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Any notice issued under the Statistics Act 1965 shall, on the date of coming into operation of this Act, continue to be valid and be deemed to have been issued under this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@/~part_VI__cl_22__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@/~part_VI__cl_22> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@> .
