<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@/~part_VI__cl_22__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@/~part_VI__cl_22__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Any officer and servant of the Department of Statistics who has been appointed before the date of coming into operation of this Act shall, on the date of coming into operation of this Act, continue to be an officer of the Department of Statistics Malaysia and shall be subject to the law for the time being in force relating to the public service of the Federation."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@/~part_VI__cl_22__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@/~part_VI__cl_22> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@/~part_VI__cl_22__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@/~part_VI__cl_22__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@/~part_VI__cl_22__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Any reference to the Department of Statistics in any written law or document shall, upon the coming into operation of this Act, be construed as a reference to the Department of Statistics Malaysia."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/21/eng@> .
